For maximum impact, aim to highlight achievements that align with the company's strategic objectives and demonstrate your ability to adapt to changing priorities. Be prepared to discuss how your contributions have not only benefited the immediate project but also contributed to the broader organizational goals. This approach will help position your achievements as management-oriented and demonstrate your readiness for more senior roles.

